  <item>
    <title>EP011：48小时逃离北京——海南岛日记！来感受海风和椰子的味道！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67be808d05a90dfd0de5caad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67be808d05a90dfd0de5caad</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Feb 2025 03:08:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又来到了和MaidaierRadio一起逃离北京的时间！不过这次的逃离超时了不少时间，就算是给大家一个小长假的备选攻略吧~现在敲下这些字的我本人，满脑子都还充斥着海岛的气息！我宣布！我永远爱大海！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本次行程我们去到了三亚、陵水、万宁、海口，进行了小小的海南岛环岛自驾游，希望能给大家提供一些海岛出游小思路~就算不能马上出发，也可以听听节目和我们一起感受海风和椰子的味道呀！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a>关于海南环岛自驾游的实用tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a>初到万宁，怎么感觉和我想象中不一样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a>珍惜黄金椰！走过路过不要错过！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a>晚上的日月湾简直是平替版的西海岸啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a>过年在北京没看到的烟花，却在万宁补了个大的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a>海口第一站：板桥海鲜市场，鲜！真鲜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1563">26:03</a>海南省博物馆：不看珍宝却能看到岁月的珍贵痕迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a>那些我以为天生生长在海南岛的东西，没想到却…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1959">32:39</a>海南粉！阿朵好像遇到了梦中情粉！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2019">33:39</a>对海大南门夜市唯一的建议：千万别吃饱了以后来！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a>恒兴发茶店，添玉评价为本次旅程最顶呱呱的一餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2468">41:08</a>拜托了！到海南一定要点老爸茶！不然太尴尬了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2641">44:01</a>骑楼老街片区：沉浸式体验当地生活的最好选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2941">49:01</a>陵水的酸粉和清水湾，真让我撕裂啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3096">51:36</a>来了这么多次三亚，亚龙湾还是最适合我们的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3182">53:02</a>我终于吃到糟粕醋了！我怎么才吃到糟粕醋啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3362">56:02</a>浮潜初体验：和小鱼们互动可太有意思了~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3768">1:02:48</a>新鸿港市场，买水果直奔这就行！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/673d8ea5f5192c1022a43181/lisw070b1u56eodVcRO6zEdaaCcJ.m4a" length="128665287" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqEa2gVfe1E7jn0ndVmP-NYvOjMs.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP010：风靡播客的假设性问答，我们也来尝尝鲜！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b6d54d606e5c5940affb9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b6d54d606e5c5940affb9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Feb 2025 07:51:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：饭团/鹏鹏</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果往后余生你只能看一部影视剧，你会选什么？如果你的手机里只能保留一个app你会留哪个？如果未来只能吃一种零食你最不能舍弃什么？本期MaidaierRadio将开启“假设性问答”模式，和嘉宾开启一场有趣对谈！准备好和我们一起在极端限定条件下探索自己内心深处最坚定的选择了吗？快来收听吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a>居然选这部电视剧作为终生剧，你有点儿作弊了吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a>珍惜每一双没看过甄嬛传的眼睛吧！求求了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a>非得选吗？我以后不听歌了不行吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a>我真的不能不跟朋友聊天！不付款也不行！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a>让我每天用荧光色穿搭见客户吗？我有点做不到……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1619">26:59</a>深灰？又一个好像在作弊的奇妙颜色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a>真的没有运动是穿礼服完成的吗？快发明一个吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1904">31:44</a>每天到点就得扣电池了！强制关机！必须困！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2215">36:55</a>如果可以，我愿意放弃熬夜，换一个平静清晨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2447">40:47</a>当代年轻人画像：无论几点睡都要保留自己的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2559">42:39</a>你们知道八大菜系都有什么吗就在这选？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3058">50:58</a>好家伙，只能选一种零食了，还得考虑健康问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3192">53:12</a>难道真的会有人不爱吃薯片吗？?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3389">56:29</a>说了这么多健康饮品最后你选可乐？好笑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3856">64:16</a>我愿意为了和这里厮守终生放弃其他小情小爱！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/673d8ea5f5192c1022a43181/lj66fY7wrVHLjC-c3AQnh_R-9gjR.m4a" length="145888541" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsV4hbB5mQKH1iIAeMqNx6Gkw91D.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP009：锐评春晚、红螺寺祈福、逛地坛庙会、单板初体验…你的春节假期都干嘛啦？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a3460dd74435e4a33fbdfc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a3460dd74435e4a33fbdfc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Feb 2025 11:15:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：饭团</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期录制于大年初五的节目，迫不及待想跟大家分享我们三个一起度过的这个精彩又充实的春节假期！快来听听吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a>对于我们三个都有点不一样的春节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="264">04:24</a>机器人跳舞将成为我今年春晚最特别的记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a>蛇年春晚，果然！等到了借伞！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a>一喜二喜和喜人奇妙夜，居然成为了我家的春晚……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a>今年春节！我终于学会了打麻将！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a>家长们为什么都不把牌摆整齐啊……我这个强迫症太难受了……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a>带着钢镚儿和水果糖的年夜饺子！它终于来了！撑死我了！你猜我这么努力到底吃没吃到……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a>说好不能出门的大年初一，睡醒发现家里没人了？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a>全家出动！去呼吸新鲜空气！去俯瞰美景！去山地滑车！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1667">27:47</a>小小红螺寺！拿下！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a>我们终于也是到了逛花鸟市场的年纪……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2029">33:49</a>餐厅推荐～好吃～好拍～好骑～好渔！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a>大年初四，我摔完了今年一年所有的跟头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a>终于滑上了单板！但是我为什么站！不！起！来！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2801">46:41</a>前面也趴了！后面也躺了！但是好玩！还去！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3259">54:19</a>大名鼎鼎的地坛庙会！我们来啦！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/673d8ea5f5192c1022a43181/lo59-CUpBdjg5UxA5vo7tWqj4T3x.m4a" length="116283075" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FueJtFY5v_DMFGrC828ayhppr91r.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP008：聊年俗，买年货，来听听90后主播的置办年货新思路！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678f3e79c3617f02a4342807</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678f3e79c3617f02a4342807</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jan 2025 07:05:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>马上就要过年啦！我们两个也已经进入了每年过年前如火如荼的置办年货环节，在刚刚完成春节大采购的这一刻，我们迫不及待想来跟大家分享我们今年都买了哪些年货好物，这期内容可真是“衣食住行”全方位覆盖了~同时也想跟大家聊聊我们记忆中的“我家过年那些事儿”，希望大家听的开心！买的愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a>你觉得从什么时间开始算过年了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a>吃，永远是团聚时刻最重要的事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a>不能说没有！不能扫地！坚决执行！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a>烟花爆竹，北京孩子心里不能提的痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a>怕夸张不敢穿的款式，怕不实用不敢买的颜色，统统考虑起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a>红色单品和谐音梗都能点缀心情！亲测！都好用！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a>每年都会重新翻出来的手串项链，给你过年打麻将帮上忙了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a>一代人有一代人的“赶大集”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a>过年一周，是东方树叶救了我的命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a>当代年轻人写照：零食也要轻食起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2792">46:32</a>关于“发发发发发发发”和“哈哈哈哈哈哈哈”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2847">47:27</a>年宵花真是个好东西！轻松搞定氛围感！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3094">51:34</a>中国最著名的出行居然是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3486">58:06</a>百年文市庙会，这不得去看看？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3624">1:00:24</a>属于北京的情怀和乡愁，且去且珍惜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3733">1:02:13</a>过年居家必备：家族小游戏玩起来</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/673d8ea5f5192c1022a43181/lqjpOilVgEnkDMWp5keb5FL05Gmu.m4a" length="128464353" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnk9gtK6CFmUfW1Ey6IzvkzLQa2n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP007：48小时逃离北京——连夜到沈阳！感受鸡架和澡堂！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677cc993cda04ef4c1f6a6c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677cc993cda04ef4c1f6a6c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jan 2025 07:10:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾∶小鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我们带来了MaidaierRadio的特别栏目——48小时逃离北京！我们两个人都特别喜欢旅行，但随着现在的工作越来越忙，能够出门旅行的机会越来越少了。这或许也是大多数生活在北京的朋友们都会遇到的问题，于是我们筹备了48小时逃离北京的系列节目，希望能鼓励大家多多出门感受这个美好的世界～未来这个系列也会不定期更新，希望大家持续收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a>眼馋！想实实在在的去感受东北的冬天！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a>宋长江麻辣面：到了东北，再也不用担心菜量啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a>十一纬路咖啡街太好拍了！麻烦大家都去站一脚！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a>来自天主教辽宁总教区的实力展现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a>迫不及待！来感受老帅和少帅的打下的江山！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a>满地的格格和旅拍，有种跨越年龄界限的美~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a>刘老根大舞台：来朝圣了！本山老师！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a>来自小鱼的疑问——真的不能给我带个冰点回来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2183">36:23</a>刘牌牌小炉子烧烤：鲜肉不隔夜！到点就三折！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2446">40:46</a>花钱啦！剁手啦！红梅文创园和原料库livehouse</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2698">44:58</a>意料之外的惊喜，来自波波笑剧场的即兴过瘾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3197">53:17</a>如果说沈阳人是沈阳的灵魂所在，那沈阳司机就是沈阳人的精神名片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3316">55:16</a>西塔，来了不想走 &nbsp;走了还想来！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3723">1:02:03</a>本次行程的压轴重头戏：澡堂子！我们来啦！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkoA-eVrOZM-9SYBAp-9ozNAjkep.m4a" length="163390141" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:24:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FojZRz0hamPbWmCS-GlOVv9Bw0T_.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP006：盘点90后心中的NBA十大巨星——“你说詹姆斯到底是不是刷子？”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676d647215a5fd520ed7285b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676d647215a5fd520ed7285b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Dec 2024 15:30:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：立志/鹏鹏</span></p><span></span><p><span>临近年底，又到了各大篮球联赛火热进行时，我们发现现在的小朋友们好像对篮球赛事的关注越来越少了，这也让我们不禁感慨 &nbsp;NBA确是我们少年时不可或缺的一段重要记忆。于是本期我们邀请到两位伙伴，一起聊聊90后心中的NBA~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a>当年的“黄绿大战”到底有多经典</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">09:32</a>给我个面子，德怀恩·韦德有没有资格进前十！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a>史蒂芬·库里带来的，或许真的不只有那一点点…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a>选阿伦·艾佛森，究竟是不是情怀？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a>蒂姆·邓肯：“未来是你的？未来还是我的！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a>老一代的经典球员，该致敬，还得致敬！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a>贾巴尔和李小龙到底什么关系啊？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2561">42:41</a>排“我心中的”凭啥要加我没看过的?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2793">46:33</a>想问问大鲨鱼奥尼尔“篮筐到底怎么惹你了啊”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a>勒布朗·詹姆斯到底是不是个刷子？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3205">53:25</a>排历史前十就是在排数据吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3575">59:35</a>科比·布莱恩特，远不只是一种精神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3928">1:05:28</a>迈克尔·乔丹——真正的篮球之神</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lo1BrW3gM0HNom2pXxwnnDDU-jva.m4a" length="139095500" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FutZDmxZ2E1MCMj7ClebNvYhbdAz.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP005：“自己的土，自己的地，种啥都长人民币”——东北记忆（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676241777d8426f692fccaad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676241777d8426f692fccaad</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Dec 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：小鱼/大洋</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是关于东北记忆的下半期内容，欢迎大家继续收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a>那些介绍东北农村生活的视频到底有多吸引人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a>90后也开始怀旧了？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a>源自炉果和槽子糕的记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a>那些写不出来字但情绪拉满的“东北语”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a>放鞭炮带来的年味儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">25:41</a>你家年货按什么单位买？反正我家是按筐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a>东北人居然是到冬天才开始吃冰棍？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1934">32:14</a>三位东北人过年回家必做的事竟然是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a>终于聊到了东北洗浴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2793">46:33</a>难道东北人不是天生就会滑冰滑雪吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a>记忆中的那些电子产品给不了的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3176">52:56</a>来自三位纯正东北人的旅游路线推荐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu_B28U1bY53cSdkgvpNPbNl_WXt.m4a" length="113365107" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpdIxqJHnp6ydkyWwrSfTlvldKQa.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP004：“东北的山，东北的河，东北的铁锅炖大鹅”——东北记忆（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6759aa92bdb9877a9729452f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6759aa92bdb9877a9729452f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Dec 2024 16:08:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：小鱼/大洋</span></p><span></span><p><span>冬天的氛围越来越浓，我们两位作为土生土长的东北人和东北家属，迫不及待的想和大家聊聊充斥在我们生活中的各种东北文化和东北人民的生活习俗～于是，我们来到了两位东北朋友的家中，想和他们进行一次深入的“回忆杀”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">1:23</a>东北含量85%的一期全程“嘎嘎乐”对谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">5:55</a>一个五块钱就能满城市跑的绝佳养老地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a>貂，身份地位的象征与财力实力的展现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a>中国最冷的地方居然不在东三省？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a>简直是接近于零的超弱边界感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a>不管多大，在东北永远会有人叫你“孩儿”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1576">26:16</a>东北菜的菜码到底有多大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a>“终于轮到哈尔滨了！”一对一刷视频就在家掉眼泪的夫妻说道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">38:09</a>没有一只鹅能活着离开东北</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a>杀年猪带来的过年超级仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3378">56:18</a>你们都能吃出来是不是东北大米？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3574">59:34</a>随便给个理由，饺子就能上桌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3684">1:01:24</a>致敬黑土地的艺术家，没见到就像没过年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4256">1:10:56</a>一句“敞亮”就全能概括的东北籍演员们</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpXg2EJcBgt5IrhyFmJCVLa-IGZi.m4a" length="145527502" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCffi7Iqywz5qbt6t8wGf3bcLEs.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP003-危险发言：重度剧本杀爱好者的创业体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67502af906a8291a70778da9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67502af906a8291a70778da9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Dec 2024 10:48:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：饭团/李李/立志</span></p><span></span><p><span>风靡一时的剧本杀大坑，你掉进去了吗？有人为了爱好通宵破案，也有人苦于阅读障碍迟迟不能入坑。本期我们邀请到重度剧本杀爱好者＆“危险发言”店主饭团，和我们聊聊那些年为了爱好展开的创业体验~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a>到底什么是剧本杀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a>到底是什么原因让大家对剧本杀这么上头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">08:01</a>剧本杀难道不是下班时间去开会吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a>开店期间最让饭团印象深刻的“车”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1199">19:59</a>遇见有阅读障碍的客人怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a>都有哪些不同类型的剧本可以选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a>“酒”本是怎么个“酒”法？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a>让人下头的剧本杀初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a>经典情感本居然秒变剧本杀版“分手厨房”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2654">44:14</a>新手选择好友组团还是勇敢结识新朋友？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2767">46:07</a>重度爱好可以支撑创业体验吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">59:31</a>永远有新的冒险在等待玩家</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsGfYAJzqGNN1ZFlHehzmA80jxvM.m4a" length="136095321" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-os-xtA8sB-5PTRvyzuox45l-0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP002:走！跟着国足来一场说走就走的旅行！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67487964c3b2a2f3342d4811</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67487964c3b2a2f3342d4811</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Nov 2024 14:37:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：子豪/格格</span></p><p><span>什么样的国足值得一场说走就走的旅行？本期我们邀请到了刚刚在厦门观看了世界杯预选赛国足对战日本的球迷夫妻子豪和格格，一起深入地聊一聊这次的观赛经历，并为我们揭秘观赛背后的那些事儿~</span></p><p><span>时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">6:04</a>本次厦门之旅的观赛感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a>子豪的追星经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a>那些为了国足想哭的瞬间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a>关于我们的看台文化和球迷组织</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1809">30:09</a>关注青训才是改变现状的更好办法吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2039">33:59</a>关于“归化”，你怎么看？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a>格格的最爱球员居然是他</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2891">48:11</a>给听众的现场观赛攻略</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3511">58:31</a>关于追星，子豪有话说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3643">1:00:43</a>特别奉送的现场tips</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3917">1:05:17</a>理想的看球搭子应该长什么样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4356">1:12:36</a>关于国足的未来期待</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqFIevY5XNJi2A7fZka9QaYhT1uq.m4a" length="158631317" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiEyJdBf5HZ3c1CSJFI0BnMmpGEF.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP001-Maidaier×李李刺青：聊聊纹身体验与刺青文化</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673ddfaf8d1233fb0db7f2dc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673ddfaf8d1233fb0db7f2dc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Nov 2024 13:24:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：李李/饭团</span></p><span></span><p><span>是不是每个人的成长过程中都会有想去纹身的冲动？有些人遵从内心想纹就马上去完成了，也有些人琢磨了好多年都还没敢走进纹身店，本期对谈一位拥有自己主理店铺的纹身师李李，以及他的顾客饭团，为大家揭秘关于纹身的那些事儿~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">1:38</a>人民教师和纹身师的双重身份，是不是太撕裂了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">4:30</a>一位纹身店主理人，身上居然没有纹身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">6:32</a>饭团的第一次纹身经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">8:41</a>大众对纹身的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a>李李的开店经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a>当纹身师有了艺术生的身份加持，品牌也就形成了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a>学纹身一定要有美术基础吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a>海外客户如何获取</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1866">31:06</a>纹身到底疼不疼？有多疼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">39:25</a>大家都是因为啥去纹身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3286">54:46</a>推荐纹身师这个职业吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3581">59:41</a>关于对未成年人纹身的态度</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsAXOXY91Hsl0L5qyhD9cCBMOOOK.m4a" length="140631367" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoPefao1qW8K-LfVc_1fNZ6PW4R_.png"/>
